### Foundation

```text
React
TypeScript
Vite
TanStack
React Hook Form
Zod
Zustand
Vitest
Playwright
```

### Design

```text
@loft/react-loft (Copan)
@loft/react-icons
@loft/tokens-loft
Inter
Olivelas UI Patterns
```

