[Comportamento]

### Empty

[Comportamento]

### No Results

[Comportamento]

### Error

[Comportamento]

### Permission Denied

[Comportamento]

## Navigation Behavior

[Comportamento]

## Responsive

[Desktop / Tablet / Mobile]

## Accessibility

[Requisitos]

## Analytics

[Eventos]

## Security

